{"symbol":"SHREDIGCEM","yahoo":"SHREDIGCEM.NS","bse":null,"isin":"INE232A01011","name":"Shree Digvijay Cement Company Limited","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Building Materials","website":"https://www.digvijaycement.com","about":"Shree Digvijay Cement Company Limited, together with its subsidiary, engages in the manufacture and sale of cement in India. It offers ordinary Portland cement, Portland Pozzolana cement, sulphate resistance Portland cement, oil well cement, and PPC, OPC, SRPC cements under the KAMAL CEMENT and CEMENT KA SARDAR brands. The company is also involved in the transportation, warehousing, fulfillment, business intelligence, logistics, technology, and supply chain solutions; and provision of break-bulk cargo import and export, chartering and freight forwarding solutions, and commodity trading services. In addition, it provides value added services, which include concrete mix design and cube testing facility services; non-destructive testing of concrete and testing facilities for building materials; training programs for masons, site supervisors, and engineers on good construction practices; mobile concrete lab services; field visits by qualified civil engineers; educating individual household builders on various aspects of building material and construction; and other customer specific services. It also exports its products. The company was founded in 1942 and is based in Jamnagar, India.","updated":"2026-09-25T13:37:01+00:00","quote":{"price":67.85,"prevClose":67.52,"marketCap":1003.6,"high52":97.15,"low52":53.9,"pe":55.61,"bookValue":24.73,"dividendRate":1.0,"roe":null,"shares":14.7914,"insiders":65.6,"institutions":4.52},"prices":{"dates":["2019-08-19","2019-08-20","2019-08-21","2019-08-22","2019-08-23","2019-08-26","2019-08-27","2019-08-28","2019-08-29","2019-08-30","2019-09-03","2019-09-04","2019-09-05","2019-09-06","2019-09-09","2019-09-11","2019-09-12","2019-09-13","2019-09-16","2019-09-17","2019-09-18","2019-09-19","2019-09-20","20